.group-key-container.p-4
  h2.text-xl.font-bold.mb-4 = "Group Key for #{@group.name}:"
  
  .key-info.mb-4
    .flex.items-center.justify-center.gap-2
      p.text-3xl.text-center.font-bold
        = @group.key
      = render CopyButtonComponent.new(text: @group.key)

  .instructions.mb-4
    h3.text-xl.font-semibold.mb-2 How to invite others to join:
    ol.list-decimal.list-inside
      li Copy the group key above
      li Send the key to the person you want to invite
      li They can use the key to join this group

  .back-link.mt-6
    = link_to "Back to Group", group_path(@group), class: "text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700"